ight">$<span id="resultRevenue">0</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #999; text-align: right; margin-top: -8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">±20% swing range: <span id="resultRevenueRange">$0 - $0</span></div>
                        <div class="result-row">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Monthly Gross Profit</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight">$<span id="resultProfit">0</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #999; text-align: right; margin-top: -8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">±20% swing range: <span id="resultProfitRange">$0 - $0</span></div>
                        <div class="result-row">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Monthly ROI</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight"><span id="resultROI">0%</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="result-row" style="padding-top: 15px; border-top: 2px solid #e0e0e0;">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Max Affordable CPL</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight">$<span id="resultMaxCpl">0</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div id="resultMaxCplStatus" style="font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: right;"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="suggestions-box">
                        <div class="suggestions-title">💡 Suggestions For This Scenario</div>
                        <div id="suggestionsList"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Annual Projections (12 Months)</div>
                    <div class="results">
                        <div class="result-row">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Annual Revenue</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight">$<span id="resultAnnualRevenue">0</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #999; text-align: right; margin-top: -8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">±20% swing range: <span id="resultAnnualRevenueRange">$0 - $0</span></div>
                        <div class="result-row">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Annual Gross Profit</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight">$<span id="resultAnnualProfit">0</span></span>
                        </div>
                        <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #999; text-align: right; margin-top: -8px; margin-bottom: 8px;">±20% swing range: <span id="resultAnnualProfitRange">$0 - $0</span></div>
                        <div class="result-row">
                            <span class="result-label"><strong>Annual ROI</strong></span>
                            <span class="result-value highlight"><span id="resultAnnualROI">0%</span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <button onclick="saveScenario()" style="margin-top: 20px; background: #b69d5e;">💾 Save This Scenario</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- TAB 2: Territory Database -->
            <div id="territories" class="tab-content">
                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Territory CPL Database</div>
                    <div class="form-note" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">Manage CPL by city/territory. CPLs are auto-populated when you select a territory in the Scenario Builder.</div>
                    
                    <div class="territory-list" id="territoryList"></div>

                    <div style="border-top: 2px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 20px;">
                        <div class="section-title" id="terrFormTitle">Add New Territory</div>
                        <input type="hidden" id="editingTerrId" value="">
                        <div class="grid">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>City, State</label>
                                <input type="text" id="newTerrName" placeholder="e.g., Dallas, TX">
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>Cost Per Lead (CPL)</label>
                                <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;">
                                    <span style="padding: 10px; color: #999;">$</span>
                                    <input type="number" id="newTerrCpl" min="0" step="10" style="flex: 1;">
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-note">Used when CPL Type is "Flat", or as fallback</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label>CPL Type</label>
                                <select id="newTerrCplType" onchange="toggleSeasonalCplInputs()">
                                    <option value="flat">Flat CPL (single rate year-round)</option>
                                    <option value="seasonal">Seasonal (actual CPL per season, auto-detected)</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="seasonalCplInputs" style="display: none;">
                            <div class="form-note" style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 12px; background: #e8f4f0; border-radius: 4px;">
                                Enter actual seasonal CPL ($/lead) from your ad platform reports. The calculator auto-detects today's season and uses that exact